    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d740-a4">

                <pb facs="1183" n="1087" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1087"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 29,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Zulueta</hi>: The present question settled; full
                    particulars go on by to-day’s mail. Calmness and prudence. Spain comes out of
                    the question gracefully. Acknowledge-the receipt of this.</p>
                <closer><signed>CEBALLOS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
